[[File:Oldrock Pass.png|thumb|300px|Oldrock Pass.]]

'''Oldrock Pass''' is a mountain pass leading from [[South Tide's Run]] in [[Silverpine Forest]] into [[Gilneas]]. A broken piece of the [[Greymane Wall]] lies here, a remnant of the attack on Gilneas conducted by the lich [[Naze the Eternal]]. The opening in the wall was used by the worgen to enter Gilneas shortly after the Scourge was defeated.<ref>{{questlong|Horde|40|Ebonmere Worgen Infestation}}</ref> The pass is currently overrun by worgen of the Nighthowl pack.

